{"results":[{"url":"https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2020/09/19/us/politics/supreme-court-vacancies-election-year.html","final_url":"https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/2020/09/19/us/politics/supreme-court-vacancies-election-year.html","title":"Ginsburg Supreme Court Vacancy Is the Second Closest to a U.S. Election Ever (Published 2020)","description":"The death of Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg on Friday left an opening on the Supreme Court 46 days before Election Day.","language":"en","text":"The death of Justice Ruth Bader Ginsburg on Friday left an opening on the Supreme Court 46 days before the presidential election. In U.S. presidential election years, there have been 16 Supreme Court vacancies that occurred before Election Day. Only one other happened closer to the election.\n\n\n\n\nSupreme Court Vacancies in Election Years\n\nKey\n\nVacancy\n\nannounced\n\nNominated\n\nOutcome\n\nJustice\n\nleaving\n\nvacancy\n\nElection Day\n\nYear\n\nDays before election day\n\nTaney\n\n1864\n\n27\n\nChase\n\nGinsburg\n\n2020\n\n46\n\nMinton\n\n1956\n\n53\n\nSenator Mitch McConnell vowed to hold a confirmation vote for President Trump’s nominee to replace Justice Ginsburg.\n\nBrennan\n\nTrimble\n\n1828\n\n67\n\nCrittenden\n\nMcKinley\n\n1852\n\n106\n\nBadger\n\nFortas\n\n1968\n\n132\n\nThornberry\n\nWarren\n\n1968\n\n137\n\nFortas\n\nHughes\n\n1916\n\n149\n\nClarke\n\nDaniel\n\n1860\n\n159\n\nBlack\n\nBaldwin\n\n1844\n\n194\n\nKing\n\nWaite\n\n1888\n\n228\n\nFuller\n\nScalia\n\n2016\n\n269\n\nGarland\n\nMoore\n\n1804\n\n282\n\nJohnson\n\nIn 2016, Mr. McConnell said that voting to replace Justice Antonin Scalia should wait until after the election.\n\nBradley\n\n1892\n\n292\n\nShiras\n\nHolmes\n\n1932\n\n301\n\nCardozo\n\nLamar\n\n1916\n\n310\n\nBrandeis\n\nDays before Election Day\n\n300\n\n250\n\n200\n\n150\n\n100\n\n50\n\n0\n\n50\n\n100\n\n150\n\nNote: Includes only vacancies that happened before Election Day.","author":"Larry Buchanan, Karen Yourish","published_date":"2020-09-19T07:26:55.000Z","latency_ms":6424.704926001141,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}